# 0160 WIP: N2b ruby_eint + touch EINT14.
# Moves EINT control into ruby_eint (static 32 slots, no heap in
# acquire) and lets gt_thread use pending/ack with an 8 ms fallback.
# Only GPIO14/EINT14; no GPIO4/5, PMIC/rail/clock/WDT writes.
#
# KERNEL_EXPECT_EXEC_DATA pins the booted kernel; the pin rerun is the
# gate for the same patchset.
